<%# 予実の確認の、月度の移動（path_builder は月度のパラメーター（今月度は nil）から URL を作る） %>
<nav class="month-nav" aria-label="表示する月の切り替え">
  <% if period.previous.navigable? %>
    <%= link_to "← 前#{period.unit}", path_builder.call(period.previous.to_param),
                class: "button button--ghost button--small", rel: "prev", data: { testid: "previous-month" } %>
  <% end %>
  <% unless period == current_period %>
    <%= link_to "今#{period.unit}", path_builder.call(nil), class: "button button--ghost button--small", data: { testid: "current-month" } %>
  <% end %>
  <% if period.next.navigable? %>
    <%= link_to "翌#{period.unit} →", path_builder.call(period.next.to_param),
                class: "button button--ghost button--small", rel: "next", data: { testid: "next-month" } %>
  <% end %>
</nav>
